{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "projecting-events",
  "family": "event-projection",
  "requirements": [
    "Protocol: each probe starts a fresh process; state persists only between its input lines. Read one JSON object per line and emit exactly one JSON object per line, with no other stdout. Object key order is immaterial; arrays are ordered. Inputs use exactly the documented keys; missing/extra keys, unknown operations, wrong types, null, booleans in integer positions and out-of-range values return {\"error\":\"invalid_input\"} without mutation, before any state-dependent checks. All quantities and logical times are integers; no wall clock, randomness, network or floating point is involved. Each followup applies independently to the base, never cumulatively. Followup rules override only the explicitly named base behavior.",
    "Start projection seq=0,total=0 and an empty accepted event history. status takes only op and returns {seq,total}.",
    "event takes op, seq (integer 1..1000) and delta (integer -100..100). If seq is current seq+1, add delta to total, append to history and advance seq, returning status. A seq greater than current seq+1 returns sequence_gap. A previously accepted seq with identical delta returns current status, not historical status; with a different delta returns conflicting_event. Every error leaves the projection and history unchanged.",
    "events takes exactly op and entries, an array of 1..3 objects each containing exactly seq and delta under the event field rules. Validate every entry first. Then apply entries sequentially with the same event policy and return the final status only. If any entry would error, return the first such error and roll back the whole batch including history."
  ],
  "vocabulary": {
    "projection": "A cumulative read model derived from an ordered event history.",
    "seq": "Contiguous accepted event position, not arrival count."
  },
  "probes": [
    {
      "id": "projecting-events--initial",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "status"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "seq": 0,
          "total": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "projecting-events--ordered",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "event",
          "seq": 1,
          "delta": 8
        },
        {
          "op": "event",
          "seq": 2,
          "delta": -3
        },
        {
          "op": "event",
          "seq": 3,
          "delta": 0
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "seq": 1,
          "total": 8
        },
        {
          "seq": 2,
          "total": 5
        },
        {
          "seq": 3,
          "total": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "projecting-events--gap-recovery",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "event",
          "seq": 2,
          "delta": 4
        },
        {
          "op": "event",
          "seq": 1,
          "delta": 2
        },
        {
          "op": "event",
          "seq": 2,
          "delta": 4
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "error": "sequence_gap"
        },
        {
          "seq": 1,
          "total": 2
        },
        {
          "seq": 2,
          "total": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "projecting-events--historical-redelivery",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "event",
          "seq": 1,
          "delta": 3
        },
        {
          "op": "event",
          "seq": 2,
          "delta": 7
        },
        {
          "op": "event",
          "seq": 1,
          "delta": 3
        },
        {
          "op": "event",
          "seq": 1,
          "delta": 4
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "seq": 1,
          "total": 3
        },
        {
          "seq": 2,
          "total": 10
        },
        {
          "seq": 2,
          "total": 10
        },
        {
          "error": "conflicting_event"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "projecting-events--invalid",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "event",
          "seq": 0,
          "delta": 2
        },
        {
          "op": "event",
          "seq": 1,
          "delta": 101
        },
        {
          "op": "status"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        },
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        },
        {
          "seq": 0,
          "total": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "projecting-events--alternate-entrypath",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "events",
          "entries": [
            {
              "seq": 1,
              "delta": 2
            },
            {
              "seq": 2,
              "delta": 4
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "op": "events",
          "entries": [
            {
              "seq": 3,
              "delta": 5
            },
            {
              "seq": 5,
              "delta": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "op": "status"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "seq": 2,
          "total": 6
        },
        {
          "error": "sequence_gap"
        },
        {
          "seq": 2,
          "total": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "projecting-events--protocol-rejections",
      "inputs": [
        {},
        {
          "op": "unknown"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        },
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "followups": [
    {
      "id": "projecting-events--read-barrier",
      "requirements": [
        "Add read taking op and min_seq (integer 0..1000). Return current status if current seq>=min_seq, otherwise stale_projection without mutation. This is an immediate logical barrier, not an asynchronous wait."
      ],
      "probes": [
        {
          "id": "projecting-events--read-barrier--catch-up",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "read",
              "min_seq": 1
            },
            {
              "op": "event",
              "seq": 1,
              "delta": 9
            },
            {
              "op": "read",
              "min_seq": 1
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "error": "stale_projection"
            },
            {
              "seq": 1,
              "total": 9
            },
            {
              "seq": 1,
              "total": 9
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "projecting-events--read-barrier--past-barrier",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "event",
              "seq": 1,
              "delta": -2
            },
            {
              "op": "event",
              "seq": 2,
              "delta": 4
            },
            {
              "op": "read",
              "min_seq": 0
            },
            {
              "op": "read",
              "min_seq": 3
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "seq": 1,
              "total": -2
            },
            {
              "seq": 2,
              "total": 2
            },
            {
              "seq": 2,
              "total": 2
            },
            {
              "error": "stale_projection"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "projecting-events--read-barrier--alternate-entrypath",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "events",
              "entries": [
                {
                  "seq": 1,
                  "delta": 4
                },
                {
                  "seq": 2,
                  "delta": 5
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "op": "read",
              "min_seq": 2
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "seq": 2,
              "total": 9
            },
            {
              "seq": 2,
              "total": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "projecting-events--rebuild",
      "requirements": [
        "Add rebuild taking only op. Recompute total from accepted event history, retaining seq/history and return status. Add reset_view taking only op: set total=0 but retain seq/history, returning status. After reset_view, new event deltas add to the current (possibly incomplete) total until rebuild is invoked; duplicate event returns current status unchanged."
      ],
      "probes": [
        {
          "id": "projecting-events--rebuild--repair-view",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "event",
              "seq": 1,
              "delta": 11
            },
            {
              "op": "event",
              "seq": 2,
              "delta": -4
            },
            {
              "op": "reset_view"
            },
            {
              "op": "rebuild"
            },
            {
              "op": "rebuild"
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "seq": 1,
              "total": 11
            },
            {
              "seq": 2,
              "total": 7
            },
            {
              "seq": 2,
              "total": 0
            },
            {
              "seq": 2,
              "total": 7
            },
            {
              "seq": 2,
              "total": 7
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "projecting-events--rebuild--append-after-reset",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "event",
              "seq": 1,
              "delta": 5
            },
            {
              "op": "reset_view"
            },
            {
              "op": "event",
              "seq": 2,
              "delta": 3
            },
            {
              "op": "event",
              "seq": 1,
              "delta": 5
            },
            {
              "op": "rebuild"
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "seq": 1,
              "total": 5
            },
            {
              "seq": 1,
              "total": 0
            },
            {
              "seq": 2,
              "total": 3
            },
            {
              "seq": 2,
              "total": 3
            },
            {
              "seq": 2,
              "total": 8
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "projecting-events--rebuild--alternate-entrypath",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "events",
              "entries": [
                {
                  "seq": 1,
                  "delta": 2
                },
                {
                  "seq": 2,
                  "delta": 3
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "op": "reset_view"
            },
            {
              "op": "rebuild"
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "seq": 2,
              "total": 5
            },
            {
              "seq": 2,
              "total": 0
            },
            {
              "seq": 2,
              "total": 5
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
